      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce 11 Kempton Lawn a fantastic Four-bedroom Semi Detached family home ideally positioned in this highly sought-after residential estates, just off the Navan Road.\nThis superb property boasts an unbeatable location in this highly sought-after estate off the Navan Road, with the Phoenix Park just moments from the doorstep and Ashtown Train Station within a 15-minute walk. Kempton is a mature and highly sought-after residential estate offering access to a wide range of local amenities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, supermarkets, and Castleknock Village are all accessible within a 10-minute drive, while the City Centre, Dublin Airport, and Heuston Station are also nearby. An excellent bus service operates outside the estate, ensuring convenient transport links for commuters, and the N3 and M50 motorways are within easy reach, making this a most strategically positioned home in this fantastic neighbourhood, renowned for its strong sense of community.\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 115 sqm comprises of inviting entrance hallway, large living room to front with a feature fireplace, guest WC, fully fitted kitchen and sitting room to rear. Upstairs hosts 4 generous bedrooms, master with ensuite and a main family bathroom.\nThis superb family home comes to the market in great condition and has the benefit of gas fired central heating, front driveway with gated side entrance, solar panels, B3 energy rating, EV plug.\nThe properties new owner will have the opportunity to lay down roots in one of Dublin 7's most sought after and family-oriented locations. An opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\nAdditional Features;\n- 115 sq.m\n- BER B3\n- 4 bed 3 bath\n- Semi Detached family home\n- Front driveway\n- Gas fired central heating\n Light filled interior\n- Generous sized bedrooms\n- Solar Panels & EV Plug\n- Highly sought-after estate\n- Excellent primary & secondary schools close by\n- Easy access to M50 motorway\n- Castleknock Village & Blanchardstown Shopping centre close by\n- Excellent bus routes outside estate\n- Within walking distance of Castleknock Village and the Phoenix Park\n- Within 20 minutes' drive to Dublin Airport\n- Ideal for first time buyers and those thinking of trading up\n- No Onward Chain\n- Early viewing highly advised!!"
      },
      {
